## Models

### ListInvoicesResponse



<ResponseField name="invoices" type={"array of Invoice"} required>

</ResponseField>


### GetOrganizationBillingOverviewResponse



<ResponseField name="entitlementsVersion" type={"integer"} required>
Bumps on every entitlement change for the organization.
</ResponseField>

<ResponseField name="subscription" type={"OrganizationSubscription | null"} required>
The organization-owned subscription, or null when billing was never opened or has ended.
</ResponseField>


### GetOrganizationPaymentMethodResponse



<ResponseField name="cardOnFile" type={"boolean"} required>
True once a card is captured for the payer.
</ResponseField>

<ResponseField name="paymentMethod" type={"PaymentMethod | null"} required>
Metadata for the default card, or null.
</ResponseField>


### CancelSubscriptionResponse



<ResponseField name="cancellationScheduled" type={"boolean"} required>
False when the category held no active subscription.
</ResponseField>

<ResponseField name="cancelsAt" type={"string | null"} required>
End of the final paid period, ISO 8601.
</ResponseField>

<ResponseField name="category" type={"string"} required>
Category slug, e.g. analytics or messaging.
</ResponseField>


### TerminalBillingOperation



**One of: SucceededBillingOperation**

<ResponseField name="failure" type={"null"} required>

</ResponseField>

<ResponseField name="kind" type={"BillingOperationKind"} required>

</ResponseField>

<ResponseField name="operationId" type={"string"} required>
Stable handle for this provisioning action.
</ResponseField>

<ResponseField name="resolvedAt" type={"string | null"} required>

</ResponseField>

<ResponseField name="result" type={"BillingOperationResult"} required>

</ResponseField>

<ResponseField name="status" type={"\"succeeded\""} required>
Terminal. The result is authoritative.
</ResponseField>

<ResponseField name="submittedAt" type={"string | null"} required>

</ResponseField>

**One of: FailedBillingOperation**

<ResponseField name="failure" type={"BillingOperationFailure"} required>

</ResponseField>

<ResponseField name="kind" type={"BillingOperationKind"} required>

</ResponseField>

<ResponseField name="operationId" type={"string"} required>
Stable handle for this provisioning action.
</ResponseField>

<ResponseField name="resolvedAt" type={"string | null"} required>

</ResponseField>

<ResponseField name="result" type={"null"} required>

</ResponseField>

<ResponseField name="status" type={"\"failed\""} required>
Terminal. Failure contains a stable code and retryability.
</ResponseField>

<ResponseField name="submittedAt" type={"string | null"} required>

</ResponseField>


### PendingBillingOperation



<ResponseField name="failure" type={"null"} required>

</ResponseField>

<ResponseField name="kind" type={"BillingOperationKind"} required>

</ResponseField>

<ResponseField name="operationId" type={"string"} required>
Stable handle for this provisioning action.
</ResponseField>

<ResponseField name="resolvedAt" type={"null"} required>

</ResponseField>

<ResponseField name="result" type={"null"} required>

</ResponseField>

<ResponseField name="status" type={"\"pending\""} required>
Accepted and still executing. Poll the operation route.
</ResponseField>

