</ResponseField>


### CreateOrganizationPaymentMethodCheckoutResponse



<ResponseField name="checkoutUrl" type={"string (uri)"} required>
Hosted Stripe page; send the user here.
</ResponseField>


### CreateOrganizationSetupIntentResponse



<ResponseField name="clientSecret" type={"string"} required>
Stripe SetupIntent client secret.
</ResponseField>

<ResponseField name="publishableKey" type={"string"} required>
Publishable key for the Stripe account backing billing.
</ResponseField>


### ResumeSubscriptionResponse



<ResponseField name="category" type={"string"} required>
Category slug, e.g. analytics or messaging.
</ResponseField>

<ResponseField name="resumed" type={"boolean"} required>
False when the subscription was not scheduled to cancel.
</ResponseField>


